# Only build inputs; Git history and operator state are not sent to the builder.
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!build.rs
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!third_party/LiteLLM-LICENSE.txt
!src/**

# Keep local credentials and Python artifacts out even under source directories.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
